{"1498060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nanomon Virtual Pet", "steam_appid": 1498060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3769510], "detailed_description": "<h1>Post-Launch Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/f5fe249a198815cd7b58cd626e724eb0.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=717 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/cf8ba4ebc001dfa9aad1bad3e8ff7d8a.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🥚 Raise a unique Nanomon in the style of classic digital pet games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍖 Feed them exotic foods to discover new evolutions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 Uncover the Nanoscape, inspired by Adventure Time, Digimon, and Tamagotchi </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎣 Play games with your Nanomon like Fishing, Stick-ball, and Dungeon-diving </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥊 Fight in fast-paced battles while exploring the world</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatched in the depths of cyberspace, every Nanomon needs a tamer This is your chance to raise a pet monster from the safety of your desktop! From Magical Cats, to Retro Dragons, there’s a Nanomon to match everyone’s style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/899505b0456007360757d395f3f08eb8.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/899505b0456007360757d395f3f08eb8.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/899505b0456007360757d395f3f08eb8.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skill as a tamer will determine whether your monster becomes the STRONGEST, the FASTEST, or maybe just the best watermelon farmer in the Nanoscape? Use your trusty Guide Book to help your Nanomon reach its full potential! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/bd7326438315c374cd121b05de3b38d2.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/bd7326438315c374cd121b05de3b38d2.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/bd7326438315c374cd121b05de3b38d2.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wanna be the very best? You wanna be a legend? Then hone your Nanomon into a fierce fighter! Battle your friends online, duking it out with your best Nanomon, see who has what it takes to win! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/3887807cc83cfc80ba4271daf42595ea.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/3887807cc83cfc80ba4271daf42595ea.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/3887807cc83cfc80ba4271daf42595ea.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard at work? Or hardly working? Nanomon has you covered either way. You can dive into a dungeon, head out fishing, or just play ball with your Nano-pal. When you need a break, they’re always down to have a nap at Home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/f627a3a24abdc5132cc5d2390fe482db.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/f627a3a24abdc5132cc5d2390fe482db.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/f627a3a24abdc5132cc5d2390fe482db.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nanoscape is a massive world that fits into a tiny window! The secrets of the Nanoscape are yours to uncover! Exploring ever-changing biomes, feeding them new foods, and… cleaning up its business. Nanomon are curious and ready to roll, so prepare for adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatched in the depths of cyberspace, every Nanomon needs a tamer This is your chance to raise a pet monster from the safety of your desktop! From Magical Cats, to Retro Dragons, there’s a Nanomon to match everyone’s style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/899505b0456007360757d395f3f08eb8.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/899505b0456007360757d395f3f08eb8.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/899505b0456007360757d395f3f08eb8.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skill as a tamer will determine whether your monster becomes the STRONGEST, the FASTEST, or maybe just the best watermelon farmer in the Nanoscape? Use your trusty Guide Book to help your Nanomon reach its full potential! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/bd7326438315c374cd121b05de3b38d2.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/bd7326438315c374cd121b05de3b38d2.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/bd7326438315c374cd121b05de3b38d2.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wanna be the very best? You wanna be a legend? Then hone your Nanomon into a fierce fighter! Battle your friends online, duking it out with your best Nanomon, see who has what it takes to win! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/3887807cc83cfc80ba4271daf42595ea.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/3887807cc83cfc80ba4271daf42595ea.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/3887807cc83cfc80ba4271daf42595ea.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard at work? Or hardly working? Nanomon has you covered either way. You can dive into a dungeon, head out fishing, or just play ball with your Nano-pal. When you need a break, they’re always down to have a nap at Home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/f627a3a24abdc5132cc5d2390fe482db.poster.avif?t=1786046760\" width=780 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/f627a3a24abdc5132cc5d2390fe482db.webm?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/f627a3a24abdc5132cc5d2390fe482db.mp4?t=1786046760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nanoscape is a massive world that fits into a tiny window! The secrets of the Nanoscape are yours to uncover! Exploring ever-changing biomes, feeding them new foods, and… cleaning up its business. Nanomon are curious and ready to roll, so prepare for adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Nanomon are byte-sized virtual pets for the corner of your screen! Raise over 25 unique monsters, and explore their cyber-world! Feed them, train them, or chill with them! By your side, nanomon evolve, learn new abilities, and venture further into the Nanoscape! What kind of monster will you raise?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“To say that I like the game is an understatement; it has so much to offer while still being so very simple in its concept.”<br>Platinum Award – Thumb Culture<br><br>“The game is a truly adorable experience, there is a real joy in improving the stats of your Nanomon and fighting the wild ones you come across.”<br>Gud Shiz<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.ste